Description: Python client for the Sangfor Cloud Platform (SCP) Open-API
 sangfor-scp is a Python client library for the Sangfor Cloud Platform (SCP)
 Open-API. It covers virtual machines (create, clone, migrate, power,
 console), networks, images, volumes, elastic IPs, tasks, alarms and
 monitoring metrics, with EC2 (AWS4-HMAC-SHA256) and token authentication,
 automatic pagination and async task polling.
 .
 It also ships the scp-health command, a read-only platform health report
 (alarms, VM disk usage, failed tasks, host CPU generations, capacity).
